      "writtenOn": "2022-09-23T07:54:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not just fix this properly upstream so that no hook is needed at all?\n\nThen we can take the backported fix as a bugfix easily.",
      "revId": "b4e36980d158254f754cc015d8e6b265ba7b5771",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e1a9d148_33fb076d",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
