      "writtenOn": "2022-09-24T13:49:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Greg, please refer to the base patch of MTK UFS MCQ implementation in ACK13-5.15 first: https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2104904\n\nWe would not expect that we need to do different way for following fixes of this implementation.",
      "parentUuid": "d2526d08_40f9fa20",
      "revId": "b4e36980d158254f754cc015d8e6b265ba7b5771",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
